  "policies": [
    "Chromatic Broodmother uses native Rush and own attack_declared notification, refreshing mana equal to the original behavior source Attack via existing RefreshMana; it neither grants max crystals nor substitutes damage dealt. Dragon and Undead retained.",
    "Aessina uses genuine friendly MINION DeathRecord.controller history, at least20 this game, including deaths before acquisition and actual Reborn deaths. Bounce/transform/removal and enemy deaths do not count. Existing SplitDamage20 MINION_ABILITY resolves one current random enemy per packet.",
    "Dread Raptor tutors one original physical DECK minion with a current Deathrattle and current stored cost<=3. Kindred prepares a zero-cost reward for the actual surviving original hand arrival; repeats duplicate the cost component, not the draw. Native current-source qualifier, original tutor/capacity/CWD/replacement and existing Kindred one-use sources remain shared.",
    "Blackwing Experiment produces its actual fixed2-Mana Dragon Breath. Its immutable base value belongs to the actual original Deathrattle execution: natural death uses frozen DeathRecord Attack; effect/stored invocation uses the existing first-accepted/fresh-repeat body source view. The shared DeathrattleRecord saves that execution Attack once, not a new mutable minion counter. Value is installed before acquisition events, copied with physical card material and captured by actual CAST; direct spell-history recast preserves the original bound value. Zero is a real bound value. Raw SCRIPT_DATA1=1 and API missing number do not define a fallback1; unbound value explicitly errors.",
    "Chronochiller is a removable native continuous provider at the actual normal turn-start draw window. It suppresses only that normal Draw request, not manual/draw-effect requests or the whole turn. Death/silence/transformation/control/dormancy follow existing active printed source lifecycle. Suppressed empty-deck draw does not cause fatigue.",
    "Current official en_US/zh_CN faces agree after explicitly removing dynamic/layout placeholders. Precise attack operand, conditional tutor, generated parameter inheritance/recast and start-trigger/draw ordering remain local M6 policies pending CN calibration. No partial generation pool opened."
  ]
